WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.300
Welcome to HabTastic AI — everything works together as one daily system

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:11.000
across five bottom tabs: Home, Habits, Progress, Winston AI, and Premium.

3
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:16.900
Start each day on your Home dashboard under Today's Quests. Tap any habit to complete it,

4
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.350
log how you feel, earn XP, and finish every quest to unlock your Daily Reward Chest.

5
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:29.100
In the Habits tab, create daily, weekly, or custom-day routines and pick Easy, Medium, or Hard difficulty.

6
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:34.700
Set smart reminders and arm a Streak Shield so one busy day never resets your streak.

7
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:40.300
Tap the Winston tab anytime for voice or text coaching inside your routine.

8
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:45.450
Winston reads your real habits and streaks to adjust schedules, build bounce-back plans, and run weekly reviews.

9
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:51.600
Track named savings goals right on Home with Money Saver to stay on pace for your target date.

10
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:57.150
Then open Progress and your private Diary to view consistency heatmaps, climb leaderboards, and reflect.

11
00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:03.600
Every new account includes a 5-day full Premium trial, and you can stay on Free forever or keep unlimited access.

12
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:08.600
Add your first quest today and build unstoppable momentum!
